description:
Converts ring sizes between US, UK letters, EU/ISO circumference and Japanese scales, from a US size (3-13 in halves) or a measured inside diameter in mm. UK letter charts vary by up to half a size between jewelers. The page at redbison.dev/ring-size-converter shows the full chart.

Returns: Text: the size in all four systems. structuredContent { us, uk, euIso, japan, diameterMm, circumferenceMm }.
Example input: {"us":7}
